    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Z virus, able to turn anyone into a monster, was stolen?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get the Z virus back from the hands of evil before the entire world gets infested by monsters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712440/extras/dd8cdf36b1e0be06a2d200aeb9e77f59.poster.avif?t=1752806306\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712440/extras/dd8cdf36b1e0be06a2d200aeb9e77f59.webm?t=1752806306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712440/extras/dd8cdf36b1e0be06a2d200aeb9e77f59.mp4?t=1752806306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u300a STORY \u300b</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dr. Zstein is an eccentric scientist hard at work studying the Z virus, a new strain that can turn anyone infected into a ferocious monster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, an assistant Zzalgun who was accidentally exposed to the Z virus gained superpowers instead of turning into a monster!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712440/extras/c42a5a27c4e0b27515a3ea712cc99663.poster.avif?t=1752806306\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712440/extras/c42a5a27c4e0b27515a3ea712cc99663.webm?t=1752806306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712440/extras/c42a5a27c4e0b27515a3ea712cc99663.mp4?t=1752806306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet, Lead Researcher X, wanting to conquer the world with the Z virus, steals all the research data and antidotes before running away, but in doing so, the Z virus escapes the confines of the lab...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can Dr. Zstein and the Zzalgun, mankind's last hope, stop Lead Researcher X and save the world from these mutations?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u300a GAMEPLAY \u300b</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25b6 A 2D tower defense against legions of advancing monsters!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The monsters created by Lead Researcher X are throwing the world into chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your limited resources to efficiently train your various super soldiers and send them out to face the ever-advancing hordes of monsters. Craft your own strategy to topple the enemy towers and liberate the monster-infested regions one by one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712440/extras/51703c48b8c8e48a21189642cc3844ec.poster.avif?t=1752806306\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712440/extras/51703c48b8c8e48a21189642cc3844ec.webm?t=1752806306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712440/extras/51703c48b8c8e48a21189642cc3844ec.mp4?t=1752806306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25b6 Create your own army of super soldiers!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Claim victory in these fierce battles to gain coins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your acquired coins to make use of Dr. Zstein's advanced Z virus tech. Raise new super soldiers or strengthen existing ones to build the strongest platoon possible to fit your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712440/extras/85aec2f39e1905f07e9adf9296ecfb95.poster.avif?t=1752806306\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712440/extras/85aec2f39e1905f07e9adf9296ecfb95.webm?t=1752806306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712440/extras/85aec2f39e1905f07e9adf9296ecfb95.mp4?t=1752806306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25b6 Today's Meme characters finally get their own game!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters from the popular emoji pack Today's Meme appear in the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All of the characters from Today's Meme show off their extraordinary skills and visuals! Even the towers pop in this game as you leap into gratifying battle alongside these Today's Meme characters to save the world in peril!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712440/extras/dbeba8e7e1b017bc1a90e48c59114bf9.poster.avif?t=1752806306\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712440/extras/dbeba8e7e1b017bc1a90e48c59114bf9.webm?t=1752806306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712440/extras/dbeba8e7e1b017bc1a90e48c59114bf9.mp4?t=1752806306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25b6 Game highlights</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Six worlds crafted in a unique cartoony style</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Over 100 stages to test your strategic skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Over 90 super soldiers with extraordinary visuals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 The freedom to craft your own super soldier battalion</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Achievements unlockable by all skill levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u203b Regarding gameplay upload and streaming</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Any individual or company may stream or upload videos of this game as long as the copyright information and store URLs are included within the video description or the video itself. We would appreciate creators leaving out spoilers of the ending whenever possible.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Z virus, able to turn anyone into a monster, was stolen?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get the Z virus back from the hands of evil before the entire world gets infested by monsters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712440/extras/dd8cdf36b1e0be06a2d200aeb9e77f59.poster.avif?t=1752806306\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712440/extras/dd8cdf36b1e0be06a2d200aeb9e77f59.webm?t=1752806306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712440/extras/dd8cdf36b1e0be06a2d200aeb9e77f59.mp4?t=1752806306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u300a STORY \u300b</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dr. Zstein is an eccentric scientist hard at work studying the Z virus, a new strain that can turn anyone infected into a ferocious monster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, an assistant Zzalgun who was accidentally exposed to the Z virus gained superpowers instead of turning into a monster!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712440/extras/c42a5a27c4e0b27515a3ea712cc99663.poster.avif?t=1752806306\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712440/extras/c42a5a27c4e0b27515a3ea712cc99663.webm?t=1752806306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712440/extras/c42a5a27c4e0b27515a3ea712cc99663.mp4?t=1752806306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yet, Lead Researcher X, wanting to conquer the world with the Z virus, steals all the research data and antidotes before running away, but in doing so, the Z virus escapes the confines of the lab...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can Dr. Zstein and the Zzalgun, mankind's last hope, stop Lead Researcher X and save the world from these mutations?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u300a GAMEPLAY \u300b</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25b6 A 2D tower defense against legions of advancing monsters!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The monsters created by Lead Researcher X are throwing the world into chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your limited resources to efficiently train your various super soldiers and send them out to face the ever-advancing hordes of monsters. Craft your own strategy to topple the enemy towers and liberate the monster-infested regions one by one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712440/extras/51703c48b8c8e48a21189642cc3844ec.poster.avif?t=1752806306\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712440/extras/51703c48b8c8e48a21189642cc3844ec.webm?t=1752806306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712440/extras/51703c48b8c8e48a21189642cc3844ec.mp4?t=1752806306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25b6 Create your own army of super soldiers!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Claim victory in these fierce battles to gain coins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your acquired coins to make use of Dr. Zstein's advanced Z virus tech. Raise new super soldiers or strengthen existing ones to build the strongest platoon possible to fit your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712440/extras/85aec2f39e1905f07e9adf9296ecfb95.poster.avif?t=1752806306\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712440/extras/85aec2f39e1905f07e9adf9296ecfb95.webm?t=1752806306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712440/extras/85aec2f39e1905f07e9adf9296ecfb95.mp4?t=1752806306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25b6 Today's Meme characters finally get their own game!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters from the popular emoji pack Today's Meme appear in the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All of the characters from Today's Meme show off their extraordinary skills and visuals! Even the towers pop in this game as you leap into gratifying battle alongside these Today's Meme characters to save the world in peril!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712440/extras/dbeba8e7e1b017bc1a90e48c59114bf9.poster.avif?t=1752806306\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712440/extras/dbeba8e7e1b017bc1a90e48c59114bf9.webm?t=1752806306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712440/extras/dbeba8e7e1b017bc1a90e48c59114bf9.mp4?t=1752806306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25b6 Game highlights</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Six worlds crafted in a unique cartoony style</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Over 100 stages to test your strategic skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Over 90 super soldiers with extraordinary visuals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 The freedom to craft your own super soldier battalion</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Achievements unlockable by all skill levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u203b Regarding gameplay upload and streaming</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Any individual or company may stream or upload videos of this game as long as the copyright information and store URLs are included within the video description or the video itself. We would appreciate creators leaving out spoilers of the ending whenever possible.</p>",
